# The generated article and its figures, which aastex writes next to the
# .tex file. Both are reproducible by running `esis2_science_paper.pdf()`,
# so neither is committed. Static figures that are not generated belong in a
# subdirectory (e.g. `figures/static/`) so that they are not ignored here.
esis2_science_paper/esis2-science.tex
esis2_science_paper/*.pdf
esis2_science_paper/*.png

# The AASTeX class, bibliography style, and ORCID logo, which aastex copies
# next to the .tex file at build time and leaves there when the .tex is kept.
esis2_science_paper/aastex701.cls
esis2_science_paper/aasjournalv7.bst

# submission archives built by `aastex.Document.generate_archive()`
*.zip
*.tar.gz
